{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Catventure</i>, you take on the role of a fearless feline archer on an epic journey to face the forces of darkness! With every step inside the vampire's tower, you'll encounter hordes of battle-hungry enemies. With quick reflexes and sharp strategy, dodge projectiles, shoot with precision, and use special abilities to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME HIGHLIGHTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f <strong>Intense bullet-hell action</strong> \u2013 dodge swarms of projectiles while taking down enemies with your bow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531750/extras/chuvadebalas.gif?t=1771872698\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Strategic progression system</strong> \u2013 choose between attribute upgrades, skills, and passive abilities at each level-up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531750/extras/selecao_melhoria_eng.gif?t=1771872698\" /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Forge and upgrade equipment</strong> \u2013 strengthen your character to take on greater challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531750/extras/9a6f0cda43d28f7f7f59e0bc638e7d48.poster.avif?t=1771872698\" width=900 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531750/extras/9a6f0cda43d28f7f7f59e0bc638e7d48.webm?t=1771872698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531750/extras/9a6f0cda43d28f7f7f59e0bc638e7d48.mp4?t=1771872698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd87 <strong>Epic boss battles</strong> \u2013 fight colossal enemies and master their attack patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531750/extras/anubis.gif?t=1771872698\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for battle and find out if you have what it takes to defeat the vampire and save your beloved!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3531750?t=1771872698","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3531750?t=1771872698","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531750/388ad110ad2d01c91695168a89cbcb2b0e8cd5f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771872698","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531750/388ad110ad2d01c91695168a89cbcb2b0e8cd5f3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771872698","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4336380,"description":""},{"appid":4336380,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Catventure</i>, you take on the role of a fearless feline archer on an epic journey to face the forces of darkness! With every step inside the vampire's tower, you'll encounter hordes of battle-hungry enemies. With quick reflexes and sharp strategy, dodge projectiles, shoot with precision, and use special abilities to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME HIGHLIGHTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f <strong>Intense bullet-hel